        "Description": "The Doctor says that they have found the pestilence while clearly investigating something completely different.\r\rNow, while I am unsure whether this is due to the infulence of the pestilence or their complete incompetence, I do know they are hopeless in their search.\r\rI&apos;ve have to unfortunately subdue the guards that were assinged to me in order to make it here where I have four leads\r\rI should get to work\r\r49",
